        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "To save his wife A Rou, Lang Wujue sets out on a dangerous demon-hunting journey but is tricked by Daoist Baiyun and transformed into a beast. With A Rou’s awakened spirit, she begins a long, difficult quest to break the curse and restore his humanity.",
